  @MountInstructions = "Clone this rig into the matching weapon; align rig.CFrame to Handle.CFrame. Unanchor and weld rig to Handle, or move all attachments and Trails into Handle preserving their local positions. Rescale attachment positions only if the weapon dimensions change. This stored template does not activate itself."
  @Role = "Passive blade-aligned swing template"
  @TriggerInstructions = "A future cosmetic controller enables all three Trails only during the forward cut, emits each particle once with SuggestedEmitCount, then disables Trails before recovery. Preserve the mounted rig for 0.55 seconds after drawing stops before pooling. Clear Trails and particles only for intentional cancellation."
